[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2974728859","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107556#issuecomment-2974728859","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107556","id":2974728859,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xTsKb","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-15T22:38:33Z","updated_at":"2025-06-15T22:39:00Z","body":"Hi! You asked for feedback in RocketChat :) At a glance, I think this is the correct approach to go about adding this feature. \r\nNote that `TypedArray` and `TypedDictionary` will have to support nesting also, which may require you to work some C++ templates trickery. Plus, since core's current types system isn't first order yet, we may end up with some logic duplication because `Dictionary` uses two separate `ContainerTypeValidate` for key and value. Ideally, this PR should avoid as much duplication as possible. You'll have to figure that out as you work out the rest of the logic :) Good luck!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com